{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":62,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the choir director, to Jeduthun. A Psalm of David","tok":[{"t":"To the choir director, to "},{"t":"Jeduthun","s":["H3038"],"a":[2]},{"t":". A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[4]}]},{"n":1,"text":"My soul waits in silence for God alone; My salvation is from Him.","tok":[{"t":"My "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"waits","s":["H1747"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in silence for "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[2]},{"t":" alone; My "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[6]},{"t":" is from Him."}]},{"n":2,"text":"He alone is my rock and my salvation, My high retreat; I will not be greatly shaken.","tok":[{"t":"He alone is my "},{"t":"rock","s":["H6697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and my "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[3]},{"t":", My high retreat; I will not be "},{"t":"greatly","s":["H7227"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"shaken","s":["H4131"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"How long will you assail a man So that you may slay him, all of you, Like a leaning wall or a tottering fence?","tok":[{"t":"How long will you assail a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[4]},{"t":" So that you may slay him, all of you, Like a leaning "},{"t":"wall","s":["H7023"],"a":[7]},{"t":" or a "},{"t":"tottering","s":["H1760"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"fence","s":["H1447"],"a":[9]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":4,"text":"They only make plans to thrust him down from his dignity; They take delight in lies; With their mouth they bless, But inwardly they curse. Selah","tok":[{"t":"They only make plans to thrust him "},{"t":"down","s":["H5080"],"a":[3]},{"t":" from his dignity; They take "},{"t":"delight","s":["H7521"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"lies","s":["H3577"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; With "},{"t":"their","s":["H1288"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[6]},{"t":" they "},{"t":"bless","s":["H1288"],"a":[7]},{"t":", But "},{"t":"inwardly","s":["H7130"],"a":[8]},{"t":" they "},{"t":"curse","s":["H7043"],"a":[9]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[10]}]},{"n":5,"text":"My soul, wait in silence for God alone, For my expectation is from Him.","tok":[{"t":"My "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"wait","s":["H1826"],"a":[2]},{"t":" in silence for "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" alone, For my "},{"t":"expectation","s":["H8615"],"a":[6]},{"t":" is from Him."}]},{"n":6,"text":"He alone is my rock and my salvation, My high retreat; I will not be shaken.","tok":[{"t":"He alone is my "},{"t":"rock","s":["H6697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and my "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[3]},{"t":", My high retreat; I will not be shaken."}]},{"n":7,"text":"On God my salvation and my glory depend; The rock of my strength, my refuge, is in God.","tok":[{"t":"On "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3468"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and my "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[3]},{"t":" depend; The "},{"t":"rock","s":["H6697"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"strength","s":["H5797"],"a":[5]},{"t":", my "},{"t":"refuge","s":["H4268"],"a":[6]},{"t":", is in "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Trust in Him at all times, O people; Pour out your heart before Him; God is a refuge to us. Selah","tok":[{"t":"Trust","s":["H0982"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in Him at all "},{"t":"times","s":["H6256"],"a":[3]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; Pour "},{"t":"out","s":["H8210"],"a":[5]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[6]},{"t":" Him; "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[8]},{"t":" is a "},{"t":"refuge","s":["H4268"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to us. "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[11]}]},{"n":9,"text":"Men of low degree are but a vapor; Men of high degree, a lie. In the balances they go up; Together they are less than a vapor.","tok":[{"t":"Men","s":["H0120"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of low degree are but a vapor; "},{"t":"Men","s":["H0376"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of high degree, a "},{"t":"lie","s":["H3577"],"a":[4]},{"t":". In the "},{"t":"balances","s":["H3976"],"a":[7]},{"t":" they go up; Together they are less than a vapor."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Do not trust in oppression, And do not vainly hope in robbery; If wealth increases, Do not set your heart on it.","tok":[{"t":"Do not "},{"t":"trust","s":["H0982"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"oppression","s":["H6233"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And do not "},{"t":"vainly","s":["H1891"],"a":[5]},{"t":" hope in "},{"t":"robbery","s":["H1498"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; If wealth "},{"t":"increases","s":["H5107"],"a":[8]},{"t":", Do not "},{"t":"set","s":["H7896"],"a":[10]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[11]},{"t":" on it."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Once has God spoken; Twice have I heard this, That strength belongs to God.","tok":[{"t":"Once","s":["H0259"],"a":[0]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H1696"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Twice","s":["H8147"],"a":[3]},{"t":" have I "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"this","s":["H2098"],"a":[4]},{"t":", That strength belongs to "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"To You also, O Lord, belongs lovingkindness; For You repay every man according to his work.","tok":[{"t":"To You also, O "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[1]},{"t":", belongs lovingkindness; For You repay every "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[6]},{"t":" according to his "},{"t":"work","s":["H4639"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]}]}
